                    "axiomasoft/vaulter-media": "Content-addressed file/blob layer (CAS): the concrete ContentStore/StorageDriver/BlobStore engine behind the Contracts\\Cas seam. Required for Drive file upload/download/versioning.",
                    "axiomasoft/vaulter-drive": "File/folder tree behaviour + resumable uploads: StorageManager, the DriveHandle factory, PurgeTrash/SweepUploads. Required for Vaulter::for()/forStorage() and the Drive REST surface.",
